Designing heterostructured FeP–CoP for oxygen evolution reaction: Interface engineering to enhance electrocatalytic performance
Shuang Hou\(^{1,2}\), Ansi Zhang\(^{1}\), Qi Zhou\(^{1}\), Yingjie Wen\(^{2}\), Sixie Zhang\(^{2,3}\), Linfeng Su\(^{2}\), Xinjie Huang\(^{2}\), Tian Wang\(^{2}\), Kun Rui\(^{4}\), Cheng Wang\(^{1}\), Huiling Liu\(^{1}(\)✉\), Zhiyi Lu\(^{2,3}\), and Peilei He\(^{2,3}(\)✉\()\)
